        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Ellesmere Port Town F.C., Ford Motors F.C., West Cheshire Association Football League\n- Places: Cheshire, Dunkirk Lane\n- Topics: English football leagues, sponsorship, competition levels\n\nFacts:\n- The West Cheshire Association Football League is an English football league in the county of Cheshire.\n- The current principal sponsor of the West Cheshire Association Football League is Carlsberg.\n- Ford Motors F.C. competes in the West Cheshire Association Football League.\n- In 1985, Ford Motors F.C. reached the fourth round of the FA Vase.\n- Ellesmere Port Town F.C. are currently members of West Cheshire League Division Two.\n- Ellesmere Port Town F.C. play at Dunkirk Lane.",
